tor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Arqaam Capital offers comprehensive &#8216;Arranging&#8217; services, as defined and regulated by the Saudi Capital Market Authority (CMA). Our arranging activities encompass a broad spectrum of services related to securities, including their offering, underwriting, and corporate finance business.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2ce5df2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2ce5df2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d2363b8\" data-id=\"d2363b8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dab63e4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dab63e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKey Aspects of Arranging Services\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-97e2a73\" data-id=\"97e2a73\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d4fd64 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d4fd64\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arranging<strong>\u00a0<\/strong><span style=\"background-color: #00427a; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"padding: 0in; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 18.5467px; font-family: Montserrat; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">\u2013\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"background-color: #00427a; font-weight: 400;\">As a CMA licensed advisor, Arqaam Capital can introduce parties in relation to the offering of securities or arrangement of their underwriting or advise on corporate finance business. (Securities Business Regulations, Chapter 1, Article 2).<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc4db02 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cc4db02\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arranging the Offering of Securities:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7928b50 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7928b50\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\">Arranging various offering methods including Exempt Offers, Private Placements, Parallel Market Offers, and Public Offers.<\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compliance with the CMA&#8217;s implementing regulations,\u00a0<\/span>including but not limited to the Offers of Securities Business Regulations and the Rules on the Offer of Securities and Continuing Obligations.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-efc835f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"efc835f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arrangement of Underwriting:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b8ef065 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b8ef065\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\">Structuring and Regulatory Compliance: Designing offering terms and ensuring legal compliance.<\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Syndicate Formation and Due Diligence: Partnering with financial institutions and conducting thorough due diligence.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a82ad4d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a82ad4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arranging on Corporate Finance Business:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f00ac4d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f00ac4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arranging Mergers and Acquisitions (M&amp;A), corporate restructuring, and strategic financial planning.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arranging Corporate reporting and compliance to regulatory requirements.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-01dac4a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"01dac4a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-512154b\" data-id=\"512154b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f15e214 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f15e214\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCapital Markets\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f78404a\" data-id=\"f78404a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;backgroun